TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:EEEIC 2026: Special session proposal (23:59 UTC+12 (assumed))
DESCRIPTION:IEEE International Conference on Environment and Electrical Eng
 ineering (EEEIC 2026)\n\nSpecial session proposal: 1 Jan 2026\, 23:59 UTC+
 12 (assumed)\n\nConference: June 29 - July 2\, 2026\nLocation: Lisbon\, Po
 rtugal\nVenue: Centro de Congressos\, Instituto Superior Técnico\n\nAll d
 ates:\n  Special session proposal: 1 Jan 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  
 Paper submission end: 11 May 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Early bird r
 egistration: 31 May 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nThe call for papers s
 tates no timezone. This is counted as UTC+12\, the earliest it could plaus
 ibly mean\, so the countdown runs out before the real deadline rather than
  after it.\n\n26th edition. Submission opened on 2 February 2026. Papers w
 ere notified within three weeks of submission and final versions were due 
 two weeks after notification. The site lists both 4 May and 11 May 2026 as
  the end of submission\; the later date is recorded here.\n\nCall for pape
 rs: https://www.eeeic.net/\nDetails: https://langestefan.github.io/powersy
 stem-deadlines/conference/eeeic26
LOCATION:Lisbon\, Portugal
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.eeeic.net/
CATEGORIES:Power Systems,Renewables,Smart Grid,Energy Storage,Power Quality
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SEQUENCE:0
